# tutorials/idealizedHeart/mesh/ is the single shared copy of the idealized
# heart's anatomy - the polyMesh, the 0/ anatomy fields, and the Purkinje
# graph - consumed by electroHeart, electroMechHeart, pathos/conductionBlock
# and pathos/ionicPathology. The whole directory is the LFS unit so that a
# new asset dropped in here is covered by construction rather than by
# remembering to extend a per-subdirectory glob.
#
# NB: anything checked out from here arrives as a ~130-byte pointer file
# unless LFS is fetched. CI must check out with `lfs: true`; a local clone
# needs `git lfs install && git lfs pull`.
tutorials/idealizedHeart/mesh/** filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
